>

  <!-- WHAT WE BUILT — kept short and owner-approved verbatim, per the Task Prompt -->
  <ShowcaseSection label="The System" heading="What We Built">
    <p>Four connected pieces, all built in Notion and a custom HTML layer, replacing what used to be separate, disconnected tools:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>A content dashboard and planning system</strong> — where campaign content gets planned and tracked in one place, instead of scattered across documents.</li>
      <li><strong>A worker dashboard</strong>, with its own popups and forms — the day-to-day workspace for the agency's reps and sales workers.</li>
      <li><strong>A management financial dashboard and control panel</strong> — the numbers and the controls the owner needs, in one view.</li>
      <li><strong>Funnel automation for recruiting</strong> — an automatic pipeline that brings in and filters worker and candidate applications, instead of handling each one by hand.</li>
    </ul>
  </ShowcaseSection>

